	'messages:managewiki-header-core' => 'en:You can manage this wiki\'s core settings (such as the name and language) from this panel. Greyed out options may only be changed by farm operators. Once done, click \'Save\' and your preferences will reflect in a few seconds.

You may manage additional settings such as logo and more at [[Special:ManageWiki/settings]].',
	'messages:managewiki-header-core-view' => 'en:You may view this wiki\'s core settings from this panel but \'\'\'you do not have permission to change them\'\'\'.

